  "description": "FL.JsonLd.AspNetCore is a lightweight .NET library that seamlessly injects a <script> tag with the MIME type application/ld+json into the <head> section of your HTML. This enables rich search results by adding structured data (JSON-LD) to your web pages, allowing search engines to better understand and index your content all with minimal configuration and effort.",
